title "Danger"
tempo 120
meter 4/4
key e aeolian
mood danger
place any
time any
depth any
worlds any
loop yes
seed 11
humanize timing 10 ms velocity 5
reverb 1.8 s 0.35
instrument strings font freepats_synthstrings preset 0:0
instrument piano preset 0:0
instrument timp font freepats_timpani preset 0:0
instrument felt font felt preset 0:0

# Something is coming for you: a low piano ostinato in eighths under a pulse of
# timpani, and a short, pressing figure (threat) that climbs (rise) and keeps coming
# back, a step at a time. It loops: the last bar leads into the first.
motif threat | mf e4:q f#4:e g4:e f#4:q e4:q | d4:e e4:e f#4:q e4:h |
motif rise | g4:q a4:e b4:e a4:q g4:q | f#4:e g4:e a4:q b4:h |

part melody strings melody volume -4 dB pan 0.15
  section A
    play threat
    play threat vary 2
    play rise
    play threat degrees -1
  end
  section B
    play rise degrees 1
    play threat invert
    play rise
    play threat
  end
  form A B A B'

